1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,416
Wake up, Lord Darren.

2
00:00:01,791 --> 00:00:03,500
Count Carter is his father,

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,291
and Redmond is his brother.

4
00:00:06,083 --> 00:00:07,916
They know Severin’s true worth 

5
00:00:07,916 --> 00:00:09,166
better than anyone.

6
00:00:09,541 --> 00:00:10,750
If he wasn’t worthless,

7
00:00:12,916 --> 00:00:15,083
 I never would have 
publicly broken the 
engagement.

8
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:17,666
Look, Lord Darren.

9
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:21,291
These are the lowlife friends he
hangs around with in the mines.

10
00:00:21,291 --> 00:00:26,666
He actually brought such filthy
scum to desecrate the Holy Cathedral!

11
00:00:26,666 --> 00:00:27,875
Enough!

12
00:00:29,625 --> 00:00:33,541
I know Lord Severin far
better than any of you idiots.

13
00:00:33,541 --> 00:00:36,250
Get out of Emeraldstone
while you still can.

14
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:38,500
Darren, you would side 
with this traitor against

15
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,333
 every noble in 
Emeraldstone?

16
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:41,291
Don't forget 

17
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:44,125
House Carter
stands behind the 
Morellan family,

18
00:00:44,125 --> 00:00:45,375
head of the Four Great Families!

19
00:00:45,375 --> 00:00:46,833
Exactly, Darren.

20
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:48,125
In front of the Morellan family,

21
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:50,208
you’re not even worth
 a toe.

22
00:00:50,208 --> 00:00:52,791
Since you all rely so
heavily on the
 Morellan family,

23
00:00:52,791 --> 00:00:54,416
why don’t you
summon them right now?

24
00:00:55,208 --> 00:00:57,291
Let’s see if
they dare touch me.

25
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:01,083
Since you’re so eager to die,

26
00:01:01,083 --> 00:01:03,458
I’ll contact the Lord
of Morellan right now.

27
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:10,166
Lady Elowen Morellan, heir of
the Morellan family, 

28
00:01:10,750 --> 00:01:13,125
has arrive!

29
00:01:17,708 --> 00:01:19,458
It's actually Lady Elowen,

30
00:01:20,083 --> 00:01:22,500
the greatest beauty of Golantis.

31
00:01:23,458 --> 00:01:24,708
Lady Elowen!

32
00:01:25,625 --> 00:01:27,875
Thank you for
gracing my son’s wedding.

33
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,291
Which son?

34
00:01:30,958 --> 00:01:33,541
Redmond, come greet Lady Elowen.

35
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,250
Lady Elowen…

36
00:01:38,250 --> 00:01:39,500
Get lost.

37
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
She said get out.

38
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,750
Are you deaf?

39
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,791
Lady Elowen told you 
to leave, move!

40
00:01:59,541 --> 00:02:02,541
Elowen Morellan, heir
of the Morellan family,

41
00:02:02,541 --> 00:02:04,708
brings the core
treasuries of my bloodline.

42
00:02:04,708 --> 00:02:06,083
Lord Severin...

43
00:02:06,125 --> 00:02:08,291
please accept me as your wife.

44
00:02:11,083 --> 00:02:12,291
Present the gifts!

45
00:02:13,291 --> 00:02:14,541
Yes, my lady.

46
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,500
Thirty-six fortified castles 

47
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:25,125
and all their endless 
territories under 
Morellan rule.

48
00:02:25,708 --> 00:02:28,000
The Morellan family’s
dragon crystal mines and

49
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,125
ten top-tier heavy armor forges.

50
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:33,791
The keys to the
four great Morellan treasuries.

51
00:02:34,916 --> 00:02:37,791
Fifty percent command
over the Morellan family’s

52
00:02:37,916 --> 00:02:43,083
one hundred thousand 
iron cavalry, effective 
immediately.

53
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,250
What? Directly sending it to the Vault?

54
00:02:50,041 --> 00:02:53,000
Half the entire Morellan family…

55
00:02:53,208 --> 00:02:55,000
handed over just like that.
